Kaha Ye Zainab Ne Peet Kar Sar<br>
guloo E Shabbir Per Hai Khanjar<br>
bapa Hai Karbobala Me Mehshar<br>
<br>
utho Kafile Hijab E Zainab<br>
<br>
1-zameen Per Bikhre Pade Hai Laashe<br>
falak Se Barse Hai Khoon Ke Dhaare<br>
udaasiyo Ke Jahaan Hai Ghere<br>
wahi Hai Tashnalabo Ke Naale<br>
lahu Lahu Hai Ye Saare Manzar<br>
utho Kafile Hijab E Zainab<br>
<br>
2-hussain Bhai Lahu Me Tar Hai<br>
na Zeen Par Na Zameen Par Hai<br>
magar Bhi Shukr E Khuda Me Sar Hai<br>
kare Na Zibha Ye Mujhko Dar Hai<br>
sawaar Seene Pe Hai Sitamgar<br>
utho Kafile Hijab E Zainab<br>
<br>
3-zameen E Karbal Pe Hai Qayamat<br>
ragadte Hai Eideiya Jo Hazrath<br>
sitam Ki Pyase Gale Pe Shiddat<br>
wo Kund Khanjar Ki Hai Aziyyat<br>
juda Hua Mere Bhai Ka Sar<br>
utho Kafile Hijab E Zainab<br>
<br>
4-rasul E Akram Ka Hai Nawasa<br>
sitamgaro Ne Hai Jisko Ghera<br>
kahi Se Paththar Kahi Se Bhaalaa<br>
mere Ghareebul Watan Ko Maara<br>
bachalo Aaqa Ko Apne Aakar<br>
utho Kafile Hijab E Zainab<br>
<br>
5-hai Ghash Me Aabid Jagaaun Kaise<br>
pidar Ki Haalat Dikhaaun Kaise<br>
mai Haal Ran Ka Sunaaun Kaise<br>
mai Jalte Qaime Bhujaaun Kaise<br>
lo Aai Shaame Ghareeba Ham Par<br>
utho Kafile Hijab E Zainab<br>
<br>
6- Behen Ko Apni Na Yu Rulaao<br>
madad Ko Abbas Jald Aao<br>
jalale Haidar Inhe Dikhaao<br>
sitmagaro Se Hame Bachao<br>
laeen Lete Hai Sar Se Chadar<br>
utho Kafile Hijab E Zainab<br>
<br>
7- Tha Jisko Naazo Se Maa Ne Pala<br>
hai Teen Din Ka Wo Bhuka Pyaasa<br>
badan Hai Zakhmo Se Chur Itna<br>
ubalraha Hai Lahu Ka Darya<br>
zameen E Karbobala Hai Muztar<br>
utho Kafile Hijab E Zainab<br>
<br>
8-ghire Hai Faujo Me Shaahe Wala<br>
har Ek Jaanib Se Kar Ke Hamla<br>
liye Hai Halqe Me Usko Aada<br>
nahi Hai Koi Bachane Wala<br>
hai Shor Hote Hai Zibha Sarwar<br>
utho Kafile Hijab E Zainab<br>
